WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.462
The browser practice database is intentionally small.

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:09.207
It includes sales, admissions, survey responses, and web events.

00:00:09.207 --> 00:00:12.592
These are not meant to be big-data examples.

00:00:12.592 --> 00:00:18.960
They are meant to help you practice S Q L logic before running the same kind of logic in Spark.
